Package: gflowx
Title: Archived Geometric Smoothing and Conditional Expectation Methods
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Pawel", "Gajer", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "pgajer@gmail.com")
    )
Description: Installable archive of retired geometric smoothing, graph
    regression, and conditional expectation methods formerly shipped in
    'gflow'. The implementations are preserved for reproducibility and
    comparison, while graph construction is delegated to 'dgraphs'. These
    methods are not under active methodological development.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
